<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Day 1: Global GitHub Deployment Protocol 🟢</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-indigo-950 to-slate-900 text-white font-sans selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white antialiased">

  <!-- 🔥 Global Profile Master Card Container 🎴 -->
  <div class="relative max-w-sm w-full mx-4 rounded-3xl bg-slate-800/60 p-8 shadow-2xl border border-slate-700/50 backdrop-blur-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:border-indigo-500/40 hover:shadow-indigo-500/10">
    
    <!-- 🟢 GitHub Status Indicator Light ✨ -->
    <span class="absolute top-6 right-6 flex h-3 w-3">
      <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-green-400 opacity-75"></span>
      <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-3 w-3 bg-green-500"></span>
    </span>

    <!-- 🌐 Nordic Quick Language Badges 🇩🇰🇸🇪🇳🇴🇫🇮🇳🇱 -->
    <div class="flex gap-1.5 mb-6 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase opacity-80">
      <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-500/30">EN</span>
      <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-700/40 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer transition">DA</span>
      <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-700/40 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer transition">SV</span>
      <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-700/40 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer transition">NO</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 🧑‍💻 Global Developer Initials & Deployment Flag 💥 -->
    <div class="h-20 w-24 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-pink-500 mb-6 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl font-black shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20 transform -rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-300">
      KK 🇩🇰
    </div>

    <!-- 📜 Headline and Titles 🎖️ -->
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 via-purple-400 to-pink-400">
      Day 1: Locked In 🔒
    </h2>
    
    <!-- 🚀 Coding Roadmap & Relocation Focus 📈 -->
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-300 font-medium leading-relaxed">
      First structural steps into the world of utility-first styling! Mastered Tailwind CSS layout systems, responsive variables, custom padding models, and spacing attributes. Copenhagen relocation strategy successfully initiated! ✈️🌍
    </p>

    <!-- 🛠️ Day 1 Execution Metrics (recruiter view) 📊 -->
    <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
      <div class="bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-700/30 p-2.5 rounded-xl">
        <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px]">STACK</span>
        <span class="text-indigo-400 font-bold">Tailwind CLI</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-700/30 p-2.5 rounded-xl">
        <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px]">TARGET</span>
        <span class="text-pink-400 font-bold">Copenhagen 🇩🇰</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 📊 Execution Progress Bar 📈 -->
    <div class="mt-6 w-full bg-slate-700/40 rounded-full h-2">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-green-500 h-2 rounded-full w-[1.66%] transition-all duration-500"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-2 font-mono">
      <span>Progress: Day 1 / 60</span>
      <span class="text-green-400 font-bold">1.66% Done</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 📥 International Git Commit Action Button 🚀 -->
    <button class="mt-6 w-full rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-purple-600 py-3.5 text-center text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white shadow-xl shadow-indigo-600/10 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-purple-500 hover:shadow-indigo-500/30 active:scale-98 transition-all duration-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-slate-900">
      Push Commit to GitHub 🟢
    </button>
    
  </div>

</body>
</html>